<kml xmlns="http://www.opengis.net/kml/2.2"><Document>
<name>Seoul ⇄ Busan for two, 28 Oct – 7 Nov 2026</name>
<description>Every restaurant here stays under ≈₩38,000 (≈€23–25) per person for food. Options are marked "(option)" / "(food option)".</description>
<Style id="Seoul"><IconStyle><color>ffe65f4f</color><scale>1.1</scale><Icon><href>https://maps.google.com/mapfiles/kml/paddle/wht-blank.png</href></Icon></IconStyle></Style>
